      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_13",
      "hash64": "D97660BDBDC27357",
      "text": "C’est quoi ?\\nUne CT ?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_13",
      "hash64": "2C6A2C047B62A03F",
      "text": "Des scientifiques de la Zone Zéro ont envoyé\\nce disque il y a longtemps aux personnes\\r\\nqui ont financé leurs recherches.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_14",
      "hash64": "2C6A29047B629B26",
      "text": "Je l’ai fait analyser, et je peux affirmer qu’il ne\\ns’agit ni d’une CT ni d’un support de stockage.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_15",
      "hash64": "2C6A2A047B629CD9",
      "text": "En fait, je ne sais pas à quoi cet objet pourrait\\nbien servir, mais il est lié à la Zone Zéro.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_16",
      "hash64": "2C6A27047B6297C0",
      "text": "Et puisque tu vas t’y rendre, j’aimerais que\\ntu en profites pour découvrir la véritable\\r\\nnature de ce disque.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_14",
      "hash64": "D9765DBDBDC26E3E",
      "text": "Et pour moi, ce s’ra une baguette pas trop cuite...\\nNan, j’rigole ![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_17",
      "hash64": "2C6A28047B629973",
      "text": "En revanche, si tu ne lui trouves aucune utilité,\\nje te prierai de me rendre le disque.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_18",
      "hash64": "2C6A35047B62AF8A",
      "text": "Tu t’es déjà rendu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e sur place, mais la Zone Zéro\\nreste un endroit rempli de mystères.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_19",
      "hash64": "2C6A36047B62B13D",
      "text": "Alors, je te demande de prendre garde\\naux Pokémon et à ton environnement.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_20",
      "hash64": "2C6727047B6061E9",
      "text": "Tu es un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e Maître[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0300)]sse, donc je compte sur toi pour\\nmener le groupe et garantir la sûreté de tous.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0300"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_15",
      "hash64": "D9765EBDBDC26FF1",
      "text": "J’serais bien venue avec toi, mais j’ai masse\\nde boulot qui m’attend ![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_16",
      "hash64": "D9765BBDBDC26AD8",
      "text": "Alors bonne chance et fais gaffe, hein ![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_21",
      "hash64": "2C6726047B606036",
      "text": "Sur ce, à bientôt.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_brother_01",
      "hash64": "3C46D606237D94A9",
      "text": "« La Zone Zéro », c’est ça ?\\nJ’veux y aller... Dépêchons-nous de partir...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
